tion:**\n\n1. **Ones Place:** 8 + 8 = 16. Write **6**, carry over **1**.\n2. **Tens Place:** 5 + 3 = 8 + 1 (carry) = **9**.\n3. **Hundreds Place:** 8 + 1 = **9**.\n4. **Thousands Place:** 9 + 6 = 15. Write **5**, carry over **1**.\n5. **Ten-Thousands Place:** 7 + 3 = 10 + 1 (carry) = **11**. Write **1**, carry over **1**.\n6. **Hundred-Thousands Place:** 8 + 9 = 17 + 1 (carry) = **18**. Write **8**, carry over **1**.\n7. **Millions Place:** Carry over **1** becomes **1,000,000**.\n\nCombining all digits: **1,815,996**\n\n**Answer:** The sum of 879,858 and 936,138 is **1,815,996**.",
