ay}\n\\]\n\n1. **Ones place**: \\(9 + 4 = 13\\). Write down 3, carry over 1.\n2. **Tens place**: \\(6 + 5 = 11\\), plus the carried over 1 makes 12. Write down 2, carry over 1.\n3. **Hundreds place**: \\(2 + 4 = 6\\), plus the carried over 1 makes 7. Write down 7.\n4. **Thousands place**: \\(1 + 9 = 10\\). Write down 0, carry over 1.\n5. **Ten thousands place**: \\(4 + 1 = 5\\), plus the carried over 1 makes 6. Write down 6.\n6. **Hundred thousands place**: \\(7 + 2 = 9\\). Write down 9.\n\nPutting all together, the result is 960,723.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{960723}\n\\]",
